- *   Ra_ideal = f²/(32R) + re/2
- *
- * Where:
- *   - Ra: Arithmetic average roughness [µm]
- *   - f: Feed per tooth or feed per revolution [mm]
- *   - R: Tool nose radius [mm]
- *   - re: Edge radius [mm]
